---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import GalleryGrid from '../components/GalleryGrid.astro';
import Lightbox from '../components/Lightbox.astro';

const summit = [
  { image_path: '/gallery/202508_sunrise/DSC09957.webp', width: 2560, height: 1440, loading: 'eager' as const, alt: '第一缕金色阳光照亮 Rainier 雪山，前景山脊仍沉在蓝色阴影里' },
];
const horizon = [
  { image_path: '/gallery/202508_sunrise/DSC09963.webp', width: 2560, height: 1440, alt: '橙色晨空下，远山与云海一层层延伸到地平线' },
];
const mist = [
  { image_path: '/gallery/202508_sunrise/DSC09977.webp', width: 2560, height: 1440, alt: '浅金色晨雾漫过山谷，森林山脊在雾中层叠' },
];
---

<BaseLayout title="Sunrise - Q's Blog" description="2025.08 | Mount Rainier 的清晨，金色雪峰、远山与山谷里的雾。">
  <div class="container">
    <header class="gallery-header">
      <h1>Sunrise</h1>
      <div class="gallery-description"><p><strong>2025.08 | Mount Rainier</strong></p></div>
    </header>

    <section class="opening gallery-section" aria-label="金色雪峰">
      <GalleryGrid images={summit} layout="single" />
    </section>

    <div class="gallery-description story-note">
      <p>清晨的光先抵达雪峰。金色沿着积雪展开，山腰以下仍是蓝灰。山谷还在暗处，山上的光已经向下移了。</p>
      <p class="place-note"><a href="https://www.nps.gov/mora/planyourvisit/sunrise.htm">Sunrise</a>，Mount Rainier 东北侧。</p>
    </div>

    <section class="horizon" aria-label="晨光中的远山">
      <GalleryGrid images={horizon} layout="single" />
    </section>
    <div class="gallery-description scene-note">
      <p>转向远处，橙色的天光横在群山之上。山峦一层层淡下去，锋利的轮廓也渐渐柔和。近处与远处之间，没有清楚的界线，只有颜色的深浅。</p>
    </div>
    <section class="mist" aria-label="山谷晨雾">
      <GalleryGrid images={mist} layout="single" />
    </section>
    <div class="gallery-description scene-note closing-note">
      <p>雾漫过山谷，树梢在其中浮出一线。群山褪去细节，只留下深浅相接的轮廓。越往远处，山与天越难分辨。</p>
      <p class="place-note">2025.08，Sunrise</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <Lightbox />
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .opening :global(.gallery-grid) { max-width: 1100px; }
  .story-note, .scene-note { max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; color: var(--color-text); }
  .story-note { padding: 1rem 0 3rem; }
  .scene-note { padding: 0.5rem 0 3rem; }
  .closing-note { padding-bottom: 4rem; }
  .place-note { font-size: 0.85rem; margin-top: 1.25rem; color: var(--color-text-muted); }
  .horizon { max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .mist { max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; }
  section :global(.gallery-item img) { height: auto; object-fit: contain; }
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .story-note, .scene-note { padding-bottom: 2rem; }
    .closing-note { padding-bottom: 3rem; }
  }
</style>
